title: Turkish Air Forces
view-if: cyprus_mode != 0
new-page: true

= Turkish Air Forces

Support the next operation roll in [+ cyprus_target_district_label +]. Actions do not advance the date. Each action can be used once every three days across all districts.

- @strike: Provide close air support (4 resources, +2 to the next roll).
- @paratrooper: Deploy airborne reinforcements (7 resources, +3 to the next roll).
- @root: Return to the operation.

@strike
choose-if: {! return !AnatolianRules.cyprusAtilla1.supportUnavailable(Q,'strike',Q.cyprus_target_district); !}
unavailable-subtitle: Requires resources, an available cooldown and room below the +6 bonus cap.
on-arrival: {! AnatolianRules.cyprusAtilla1.useSupport(Q,'strike',Q.cyprus_target_district); !}
go-to: cyprus_support_return

@paratrooper
choose-if: {! return !AnatolianRules.cyprusAtilla1.supportUnavailable(Q,'paratrooper',Q.cyprus_target_district); !}
unavailable-subtitle: Requires resources, an available cooldown and room below the +6 bonus cap.
on-arrival: {! AnatolianRules.cyprusAtilla1.useSupport(Q,'paratrooper',Q.cyprus_target_district); !}
go-to: cyprus_support_return

@root
go-to: cyprus_support_return
